        },
        {
          "text": "Baadaye akanileta tena mpaka lango la nyumba; na tazama, maji yalitoka chini ya kizingiti cha nyumba, kwa njia ya mashariki, maana upande wa mbele wa nyumba ulielekea upande wa mashariki; nayo maji yakashuka toka chini ya upande wa kuume wa nyumba, upande wa kusini wa madhabahu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ndipo akanileta nje kwa njia ya lango upande wa kaskazini, akanizungusha kwa njia ya nje mpaka lango la nje, kwa njia yake iliyoelekea mashariki; na tazama, maji yalitoka upande wa kuume. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:3"
          },
