        },
        {
          "text": "Tena itakuwa, wavuvi watasimama karibu nao; toka Engedi mpaka En-eglaimu, patakuwa ni mahali pa kutandazia nyavu; samaki wao watakuwa namna zao mbalimbali, kama samaki wa bahari kubwa, wengi sana. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
