                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nao mpaka toka baharini utakuwa Hasar-enoni, penye mpaka wa Dameski, na kaskazini kuelekea upande wa kaskazini ndio mpaka wa Hamathi. Huu ndio upande wa kaskazini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na upande wa mashariki, kati ya Haurani na Dameski, na Gileadi na nchi ya Israeli, utakuwa mto Yordani; mtapima toka mpaka wa upande wa kaskazini hata bahari ya mashariki. Huu ndio upande wa mashariki. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na upande wa kusini, kuelekea kusini, utakuwa ni kutoka Tamari mpaka maji ya Meriba-Kadeshi, mpaka kijito cha Misri, mpaka bahari kubwa. Huu ndio upande wa kusini, kuelekea kusini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na upande wa magharibi, utakuwa ni bahari kubwa, kutoka mpaka wa kusini mpaka mahali penye kuelekea maingilio ya Hamathi. Huu ndio upande wa magharibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "EZK 47:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi ndivyo mtakavyojigawanyia nafsi zenu nchi hii, sawasawa na kabila za Israeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "EZK.47.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "EZK.47.21"
            ]
